    /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
       KPI STRIP (top row of 5 tiles)
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
    .kpi-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 14px!important;
      margin-bottom: 16px!important;
    }

    .kpi {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    /* Allow kpi tiles in secondary strips to show inline badges below the unit */
    #page-cmdoverview .cwd-kpi-strip .kpi,
    #page-cmdoverview .cfo-kpi-strip .kpi {
      overflow: visible !important;
    }

    .kpi:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .kpi::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 3px;
      border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px;
    }

    .kpi.k-blue::before {
      background: var(--blue);
    }

    .kpi.k-green::before {
      background: var(--green);
    }

    .kpi.k-red::before {
      background: var(--red);
    }

    .kpi.k-gold::before {
      background: var(--amber);
    }

    .kpi.k-teal::before {
      background: var(--teal);
    }

    .kpi-label {
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.7px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .kpi-val {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--txt-1);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .kpi-val.blue {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .kpi-val.green {
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .kpi-val.red {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .kpi-val.amber {
      color: var(--amber);
    }

    .kpi-val.teal {
      color: var(--teal);
    }

    .kpi-val .small {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
    }

    .kpi-bar-track {
      height: 4px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .kpi-bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .kpi-delta {
      font-size: 9pt;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .kpi-delta.up {
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .kpi-delta.down {
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .kpi-unit {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--txt-dim);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
       GENERIC CARD
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 0px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
   
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--txt-1);
      letter-spacing: -0.1px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
    }

    .card-sub {
      color: var(--txt-muted);
      font-size: 9pt;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
       PER-WIDGET FILTER BUTTON (wfb-)
       Each widget gets a small funnel icon. Clicking it opens a
       popover where the user can override the global filter for
       /* just that widget (cluster / well selection).
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
    .wfb-btn {
 width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: transparent!important;
border: 1px solid #CBD2DC;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #5A6475;
  transition: all 0.12s;
  padding: 0;

    }

        .wfb-btn1 {
 width: 35px!important;
  height: 35px!important;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: transparent!important;
border: 1px solid #CBD2DC;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #5A6475;
  transition: all 0.12s;
  padding: 0;
 
    }

    .wfb-btn:hover {
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-btn.active {
      background: rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-btn svg {
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2.2;
    }

    .wfb-btn .wfb-dot {
      position: absolute;
      top: -3px;
      right: -3px;
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      border: 2px solid var(--surface);
    }

    .wfb-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-flex;
    }

    .wfb-popover {
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(100% + 6px);
      right: 0;
      width: 280px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      padding: 10px;
      z-index: 1000;
      display: none;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    .wfb-popover.open {
      display: block;
    }

    .wfb-popover-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 0 4px 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .wfb-popover-head svg {
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
      stroke: var(--accent);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2;
    }

    .wfb-popover-title {
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--txt-1);
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .wfb-popover-clear {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .wfb-popover-clear:hover {
      background: var(--surface-2);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-mode-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .wfb-mode {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.1s;
    }

    .wfb-mode:hover {
      background: var(--surface-2);
    }

    .wfb-mode.checked {
      background: rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.06);
      border-color: var(--accent-bd, rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.3));
    }

    .wfb-mode-radio {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1.6px solid var(--txt-muted);
      position: relative;
      transition: all 0.12s;
    }

    .wfb-mode.checked .wfb-mode-radio {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-mode.checked .wfb-mode-radio::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 2.5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-mode-info {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .wfb-mode-label {
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--txt-1);
    }

    .wfb-mode-help {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
      margin-top: 1px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .wfb-sub-pick {
      padding: 4px 4px 0;
      margin-left: 22px;
    }

    .wfb-pick-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 4px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .wfb-pick-chip {
      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--txt-1);
      transition: all 0.1s;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .wfb-pick-chip:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-pick-chip.selected {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-well-sel {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: var(--txt-1);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .wfb-well-sel:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .wfb-date-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .wfb-date-field {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3px;
    }
    .wfb-date-lbl {
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
    }
    .wfb-date-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: var(--txt-1);
    }
    .wfb-date-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }

    .wfb-foot {
      padding-top: 8px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--txt-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .wfb-foot strong {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    /* Visual scope tag on the widget itself */
    .wfb-scope-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.1);
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.25);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .wfb-scope-tag::before {
      content: '';
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .row-2-1 {
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    }

    .row-3 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {

