       P-RATING SYSTEM
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

    /* Alert banner */
    .pr-alert {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,192,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,192,0,0.4);
      border-radius: 9px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .pr-alert-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .pr-alert-icon svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      color: #FFC000;
    }

    .pr-alert-body {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .pr-alert-title {
      font-size: 10pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1F3864;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .pr-alert-text {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: var(--txt-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .pr-alert-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #FFC000;
      color: #1F3864;
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 1px 7px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-right: 4px;
