    /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
       AG GRID TABLE THEME (Command Center)
       Pure CSS restyle of the existing <table>s â€” dense
       rows, column dividers, decorative filter icon per
       header, clean row separators. No library added,
       no markup or JS changed â€” data, hover handlers,
       /* pills, progress bars, row renderers all untouched.
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
    :root {
      --ag-header-bg: #f5f7fa;
      --ag-header-fg: #6b7280;
      --ag-row-bg: #ffffff;
      --ag-row-hover: rgba(41,55,141, 0.05);
      --ag-row-border: rgba(24, 29, 31, 0.05);
      --ag-col-border: rgba(24, 29, 31, 0.08);
      --ag-outer-border: rgba(24, 29, 31, 0.1);
      --ag-row-fg: #181d1f;
      --ag-icon-stroke: #6b7280;
      --ag-font: var(--font-family);
    }

    html:not(.navbar-light) {
      --ag-header-bg: #0f1b33;
      --ag-header-fg: #9aa3b4;
      --ag-row-bg: #0f1b33;
      --ag-row-hover: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.07);
      --ag-row-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      --ag-col-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      --ag-outer-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      --ag-row-fg: #e8ecf5;
      --ag-icon-stroke: rgba(41,55,141,0.3);
    }

    /* Scope: every table class used under Command Center pages.
       Attribute selectors catch *-tbl and *-table conventions. */
    html [class$="-tbl"],
    html [class$="-table"],
    html .cc-wp-tbl,
    html .pr-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      font-family: var(--ag-font);
      font-size: 13px;
      background: var(--ag-row-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ag-outer-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Headers â€” compact uppercase with filter icon + column divider */
    html [class$="-tbl"] thead th,
    html [class$="-table"] thead th,
    html .cc-wp-tbl thead th,
    html .pr-table thead th {
      background: var(--ag-header-bg) !important;
      color: var(--ag-header-fg) !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      font-size: 9pt !important;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px !important;
      text-transform: uppercase !important;
      padding: 12px 36px 12px 14px !important;
      text-align: left !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ag-outer-border) !important;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--ag-col-border) !important;
      white-space: nowrap !important;
      line-height: 1.2 !important;
      position: relative !important;
    }

    html [class$="-tbl"] thead th:last-child,
    html [class$="-table"] thead th:last-child,
    html .cc-wp-tbl thead th:last-child,
    html .pr-table thead th:last-child {
      border-right: none !important;
    }

    /* Interactive filter button (injected by JS) */
    .ag-filter-btn {
      position: absolute;
      right: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      padding: 0;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: background 0.12s;
    }

    .ag-filter-btn svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      display: block;
    }

    .ag-filter-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(31, 56, 100, 0.15);
    }

    .ag-filter-btn.active {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
    }

    .ag-filter-btn svg line {
      stroke: #7F7F7F;
    }

    html:not(.navbar-light) .ag-filter-btn svg line {
      stroke: rgba(41,55,141,0.3);
    }

    /* Resize handle (injected by JS at right edge of each th) */
    .ag-resize-handle {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: -3px;
      width: 6px;
      height: 100%;
      cursor: col-resize;
      z-index: 5;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .ag-resize-handle:hover,
    .ag-resize-handle.dragging {
      background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.35);
    }

    /* Filter popup */
    .ag-filter-popup {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 10000;
      background: var(--ag-row-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ag-outer-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      padding: 8px;
      min-width: 180px;
      font-family: var(--ag-font);
    }

    .ag-filter-popup input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 9pt;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--ag-col-border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--ag-row-fg);
      outline: none;
    }

    .ag-filter-popup input:focus {
      border-color: #8b5cf6;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .ag-filter-popup .ag-filter-clear {
      margin-top: 6px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--ag-col-border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--ag-row-fg);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .ag-filter-popup .ag-filter-clear:hover {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    }

    /* Body cells â€” no zebra, subtle row separators */
    html [class$="-tbl"] tbody td,
    html [class$="-table"] tbody td,
    html .cc-wp-tbl tbody td,
    html .pr-table tbody td {
      padding: 13px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ag-row-fg);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ag-row-border);
      vertical-align: middle;
      background: transparent;
    }

    /* Hover */
    html [class$="-tbl"] tbody tr:hover td,
    html [class$="-table"] tbody tr:hover td,
    html .cc-wp-tbl tbody tr:hover td,
    html .pr-table tbody tr:hover td {
      background: var(--ag-row-hover);
    }

    /* Last row keeps its bottom border subtle (ag-grid convention) */
    html [class$="-tbl"] tbody tr:last-child td,
    html [class$="-table"] tbody tr:last-child td,
    html .cc-wp-tbl tbody tr:last-child td,
    html .pr-table tbody tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

