       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

    /* POC banner */
    .pi-poc-banner { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px; padding:12px 16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(41,55,141,0.06),rgba(13,148,136,0.06)); border:1px solid rgba(41,55,141,0.18); border-radius:9px; margin-bottom:14px; font-size:9pt; line-height:1.6; }
    .pi-poc-banner svg { width:18px; height:18px; flex-shrink:0; color:var(--blue); margin-top:1px; }
    .pi-poc-banner strong { color:var(--blue); }
    .pi-poc-tagline { font-size: 9pt; color:var(--txt-muted); margin-top:3px; font-style:italic; }

    /* Hero header card */
    .pi-hero { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a3160 0%,#0f2040 100%); border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px; margin-bottom:14px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
    .pi-hero::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:-50px; right:-50px; width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(245,200,66,0.15) 0%,transparent 70%); }
    .pi-hero-icon { width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(245,200,66,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(245,200,66,0.3); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; }
    .pi-hero-icon svg { width:22px; height:22px; stroke:#f5c842; }
    .pi-hero-title { font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:3px; }
    .pi-hero-sub { font-size: 9pt; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height:1.5; }
    .pi-hero-stats { display:flex; gap:22px; margin-top:10px; }
    .pi-hero-stat .v { font-size:20pt; font-weight:700; font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
    .pi-hero-stat .l { font-size: 9pt; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); letter-spacing:0.4px; }
    .pi-hero-stat .v.warn { color:#f5c842; }
    .pi-hero-stat .v.red  { color:#FF0000; }
    .pi-hero-stat .v.green{ color:#86efac; }

    /* KPI strip â€” 6 */
    .pi-strip { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr); gap:10px; 
      margin-bottom:10px; }
    @media(max-width:1200px){ .pi-strip{ grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); } }
    .pi-kpi { background:var(--surface); 
      border:1px solid var(--border); 
      border-radius:10px; padding:14px; border-left:1px solid var(--border); }
    .pi-kpi.gold { border-left-color:#FFC000; }
    .pi-kpi.red { border-left-color:var(--red); }
    .pi-kpi.green   { border-left-color:var(--green); }
    .pi-kpi.blue    { border-left-color:var(--blue); }
    .pi-kpi.amber   { border-left-color:var(--amber); }
    .pi-kpi.purple  { border-left-color:#1F3864; }
    .pi-kpi-label { font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.7px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--txt-muted); margin-bottom:5px; }
    .pi-kpi-val   { font-size:20pt; font-weight:800; line-height:1; font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
    .pi-kpi-val.gold   { color:#FFC000; }  .pi-kpi-val.red  { color:var(--red); }
    .pi-kpi-val.green  { color:var(--green); } .pi-kpi-val.blue { color:var(--blue); }
    .pi-kpi-val.amber  { color:var(--amber); } .pi-kpi-val.purple{ color:#1F3864; }
    .pi-kpi-sub { font-size: 9pt; color:var(--txt-muted); margin-top:5px; }
    .pi-kpi-delta { font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600; margin-top:3px; }
    .pi-kpi-delta.up { color:var(--red); }  /* higher incentive = bad in fraud context */
    .pi-kpi-delta.dn { color:var(--green); }

    /* Anomaly alert strip */
    .pi-alert-strip { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .pi-alert { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:9px 14px; border-radius:7px; font-size:9pt; border:1px solid; }
    .pi-alert.critical { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.05); border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.2); }
    .pi-alert.warning  { background:rgba(255,192,0,0.05);  border-color:rgba(255,192,0,0.2); }
    .pi-alert svg { width:14px; height:14px; flex-shrink:0; }
    .pi-alert.critical svg { color:var(--red); }
    .pi-alert.warning  svg { color:var(--amber); }
    .pi-alert-body { flex:1; color:var(--txt-1); line-height:1.5; }
    .pi-alert-body strong { font-weight:700; }
    .pi-alert-flag { font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:3px; letter-spacing:0.5px; color:#fff; flex-shrink:0; }
    .pi-alert-flag.critical { background:var(--red); }
    .pi-alert-flag.warning  { background:var(--amber); }
    .pi-alert-est { font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; color:var(--red); margin-left:4px; }

    /* Inflation severity badge */
    .pi-inf-badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px; }
    .pi-inf-badge.critical { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.1); color:var(--red); border:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,0.25); }
