    /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
       AG GRID TABLE THEME (Command Center)
       Pure CSS restyle of the existing <table>s â€” dense
       rows, column dividers, decorative filter icon per
       header, clean row separators. No library added,
       no markup or JS changed â€” data, hover handlers,
       /* pills, progress bars, row renderers all untouched.
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
    :root {
      --ag-header-bg:    #f5f7fa;
      --ag-header-fg:    #6b7280;
      --ag-row-bg:       #ffffff;
      --ag-row-hover:    rgba(41,55,141,0.05);
      --ag-row-border:   rgba(24,29,31,0.05);
      --ag-col-border:   rgba(24,29,31,0.08);
      --ag-outer-border: rgba(24,29,31,0.1);
      --ag-row-fg:       #181d1f;
      --ag-icon-stroke:  #6b7280;
      --ag-font: var(--font-family);
    }
    html:not(.navbar-light) {
      --ag-header-bg:    #0f1b33;
      --ag-header-fg:    #9aa3b4;
      --ag-row-bg:       #0f1b33;
      --ag-row-hover:    rgba(96,165,250,0.07);
      --ag-row-border:   rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      --ag-col-border:   rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      --ag-outer-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      --ag-row-fg:       #e8ecf5;
      --ag-icon-stroke:  #cbd5e1;
    }

    /* Scope: every table class used under Command Center pages.
       Attribute selectors catch *-tbl and *-table conventions. */
    html [class$="-tbl"],
    html [class$="-table"],
    html .cc-wp-tbl,
    html .pr-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      font-family: var(--ag-font);
      font-size: 13px;
      background: var(--ag-row-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ag-outer-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Headers â€” compact uppercase with filter icon + column divider */
    html [class$="-tbl"] thead th,
    html [class$="-table"] thead th,
    html .cc-wp-tbl thead th,
    html .pr-table thead th {
      background: var(--ag-header-bg) !important;
      color: var(--ag-header-fg) !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      font-size: 9pt !important;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px !important;
      text-transform: uppercase !important;
      padding: 12px 36px 12px 14px !important;
      text-align: left !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ag-outer-border) !important;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--ag-col-border) !important;
      white-space: nowrap !important;
      line-height: 1.2 !important;
      position: relative !important;
    }
    html [class$="-tbl"] thead th:last-child,
    html [class$="-table"] thead th:last-child,
    html .cc-wp-tbl thead th:last-child,
    html .pr-table thead th:last-child {
      border-right: none !important;
    }
    /* Interactive filter button (injected by JS) */
    .ag-filter-btn {
      position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 18px; height: 18px;
      padding: 0; border: none; background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer; display: flex;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: background 0.12s;
    }
    .ag-filter-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; display: block; }
    .ag-filter-btn:hover { background: rgba(31, 56, 100,0.15); }
    .ag-filter-btn.active { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.25); }
    .ag-filter-btn svg line { stroke: #475569; }
    html:not(.navbar-light) .ag-filter-btn svg line { stroke: #cbd5e1; }

    /* Resize handle (injected by JS at right edge of each th) */
