/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   CREW OPTIMIZATION
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
.co-body { padding-bottom:10px; }
.co-badge-new {
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.5px;
  padding:1px 7px; border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(255,0,0,0.12);
  color:#FF0000;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,0.3);
}

/* KPI tiles row */
.co-kpi-strip {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);
  gap:10px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
@media(max-width:1300px){ .co-kpi-strip { grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); } }
@media(max-width:700px){  .co-kpi-strip { grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); } }
.co-kpi {
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px;
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:10px;
}
.co-kpi-icon {
  width:38px; height:38px;
  border-radius:50%;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-kpi-icon svg { width:18px; height:18px; }
.co-kpi.blue   .co-kpi-icon { background:rgba(41,55,141,0.10);  color:#29378d; }
.co-kpi.green  .co-kpi-icon { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10);  color:#00B050; }
.co-kpi.red    .co-kpi-icon { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10);  color:#FF0000; }
.co-kpi.purple .co-kpi-icon { background:rgba(31,56,100,0.10); color:#1F3864; }
.co-kpi.amber  .co-kpi-icon { background:rgba(255,192,0,0.12); color:#FFC000; }
.co-kpi.green-fill {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,176,80,0.04), rgba(0,176,80,0.10));
}
.co-kpi-icon-empty { display:none; }
.co-kpi-body { flex:1; min-width:0; }
.co-kpi-label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  margin-bottom:6px;
}
.co-kpi-info {
  font-size: 9pt;
  margin-left:3px;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:help;
}
.co-kpi-val {
  font-size:18pt; font-weight:800;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  line-height:1;
}
.co-kpi-val-big { font-size:22pt; color:#00B050; }
.co-kpi-sub { font-size: 9pt; color:var(--txt-muted); margin-top:6px; }
.co-kpi-sub strong { color:var(--txt-1); font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.co-kpi-excellent { color:#00B050 !important; font-weight:700; }

/* Optimization Inputs */
.co-inputs-card {
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.co-inputs-head {
  display:flex; align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  padding-bottom:5px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.co-inputs-title {
  flex:1;
  font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.co-more-filters {
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:6px 14px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  cursor:pointer;
}
.co-more-filters:hover { background:var(--surface-2); }
.co-inputs-grid {
  display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-input-block {
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px;
  min-width:140px;
}
.co-input-block label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
}
.co-input-block select {
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:7px 12px;
  font-size:9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  outline:none;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.co-toggle-row {
  display:flex; gap:18px;
  align-items:center; align-self:flex-end;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  padding-top:0 px;
}
.co-toggle {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  cursor:pointer;
  user-select:none;
}
.co-toggle input[type="checkbox"] { display:none; }
.co-toggle-track {
  position:relative;
  width:30px; height:16px;
  background:#cbd5e1;
  border-radius:8px;
  transition:background 0.15s ease;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-toggle-track::after {
  content:''; position:absolute;
  top:2px; left:2px;
  width:12px; height:12px;
  background:#fff; border-radius:50%;
  transition:transform 0.15s ease;
}
.co-toggle input:checked + .co-toggle-track {
  background:#29378d;
}
.co-toggle input:checked + .co-toggle-track::after {
  transform:translateX(14px);
}
/* Optimization Inputs head â€” make space for the inline button */
.co-inputs-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.co-btn-primary {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  background:#29378d;
  color:#fff;
  border:none;
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:9px 18px;
  font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:background 0.15s ease;
}
.co-btn-primary:hover { background:#1F3864; }

/* â”€â”€ Generate Optimization Plan modal â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€ */
.co-plan-overlay {
  position:fixed; inset:0;
  background:rgba(8,12,28,0.55);
  z-index:99998;
  display:none;
  align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center;
  padding:32px 16px;
  overflow-y:auto;
  font-family: var(--font-family);
}
.co-plan-overlay.open { display:flex; }
.co-plan-panel {
  width:100%; max-width:1180px;
  background:#ffffff;
  border:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius:14px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  max-height:calc(100vh - 64px);
}
.co-plan-head {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  padding:14px 18px;
  background:#f8fafc;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-plan-head-icon {
  width:34px; height:34px; flex-shrink:0;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#29378d,#1F3864);
  color:#fff;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
}
.co-plan-title { font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.2; }
.co-plan-sub   { font-size: 9pt; color:#7F7F7F; margin-top:2px; }
.co-plan-close {
  background:transparent; border:none;
  color:#7F7F7F;
  font-size:16px; cursor:pointer;
  padding:4px 8px; border-radius:6px;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-plan-close:hover { background:#e2e8f0; color:#0f172a; }

.co-plan-legend {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  padding:10px 18px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  background:#fff;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-plan-legend-chip {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  padding:3px 10px; border-radius:10px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  border:1px solid transparent;
}
.co-plan-legend-chip.current     { background:#f1f5f9; color:#475569; border-color:#cbd5e1; }
.co-plan-legend-chip.recommended { background:rgba(31,56,100,0.10); color:#1F3864; border-color:rgba(31,56,100,0.35); }
.co-plan-legend-chip::before     { content:''; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:currentColor; }
.co-plan-legend-hint { font-size: 9pt; color:#7F7F7F; margin-left:auto; }
.co-plan-legend-hint strong { color:#1F3864; font-weight:700; }

.co-plan-body {
  flex:1;
  overflow:auto;
  padding:0;
  background:#fff;
}
.co-plan-table {
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:collapse;
  font-size:9pt;
  color:#0f172a;
}
.co-plan-table thead th {
  position:sticky; top:0;
  background:#f8fafc;
  z-index:1;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.4px; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#7F7F7F;
  text-align:left;
  padding:8px 12px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.co-plan-table thead th.co-plan-col-current     { background:#f1f5f9; color:#475569; }
.co-plan-table thead th.co-plan-col-recommended { background:rgba(31,56,100,0.16); color:#1F3864; font-weight:800; }

/* Vertical divider between Current and Recommended sections */
.co-plan-table thead tr:first-child th:nth-child(3),
.co-plan-table thead tr:nth-child(2) th:nth-child(4),
.co-plan-table tbody tr td:nth-child(5) {
  border-left:2px solid #cbd5e1;
}
.co-plan-table tbody td {
  padding:10px 12px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;
  vertical-align:top;
}
.co-plan-row.is-changed { background:rgba(31,56,100,0.025); }
.co-plan-cell-id { min-width:230px; }
.co-plan-well { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; }
.co-plan-act  { font-size: 9pt; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; }
.co-plan-reason {
  font-size: 9pt; color:#1F3864; font-weight:600;
  margin-top:4px;
  display:inline-block;
  padding:2px 8px; border-radius:8px;
  background:rgba(31,56,100,0.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(31,56,100,0.22);
}
.co-plan-cell-current     { color:#475569; background:rgba(241,245,249,0.4); }
.co-plan-cell-recommended { background:rgba(31,56,100,0.025); }
.co-plan-mono { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); font-size: 9pt; }
.co-plan-sel {
  width:100%;
  padding:5px 8px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-family:inherit;
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid #cbd5e1;
  border-radius:5px;
  color:#0f172a;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.co-plan-sel:focus { outline:none; border-color:#29378d; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(41,55,141,0.18); }
.co-plan-sel-crew { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.co-plan-time {
  width:100px;
  padding:5px 8px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  border:1px solid #cbd5e1;
  border-radius:5px;
  background:#fff;
  color:#0f172a;
}
.co-plan-time:focus { outline:none; border-color:#29378d; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(41,55,141,0.18); }
.co-plan-score {
  display:inline-block;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size:9pt; font-weight:700;
  padding:3px 9px; border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(107,114,128,0.10); color:#374151; border:1px solid rgba(107,114,128,0.25);
}
.co-plan-score.good { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10); color:#00B050; border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.30); }
.co-plan-score.ok   { background:rgba(255,192,0,0.10); color:#b45309; border-color:rgba(255,192,0,0.30); }
.co-plan-score.weak { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10); color:#FF0000; border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.30); }

.co-plan-foot {
  display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; gap:10px;
  padding:12px 18px;
  background:#f8fafc;
  border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.co-plan-btn-secondary, .co-plan-btn-primary {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  padding:8px 18px;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-family:inherit; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
  border:1px solid transparent;
  transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
}
.co-plan-btn-secondary {
  background:#fff; color:#0f172a; border-color:#cbd5e1;
}
.co-plan-btn-secondary:hover { background:#f1f5f9; }
.co-plan-btn-primary {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#29378d,#1F3864);
  color:#fff;
  border-color:rgba(41,55,141,0.55);
  box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(41,55,141,0.35);
}
.co-plan-btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(41,55,141,0.5); }
.co-plan-btn-primary svg { display:block; }

/* Recommended Assignments table */
.co-assign-card {
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px 14px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.co-assign-head {
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-assign-title {
  font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.co-assign-sub {
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  margin-top:3px;
}
.co-assign-controls {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  margin-left:auto;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

/* Date range */
.co-date-range {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  padding:5px 10px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
}
.co-date-range label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  letter-spacing:0.3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.co-date-range input[type="date"] {
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:4px 8px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  color:var(--txt-1);
  outline:none;
}
.co-date-range input[type="date"]:focus { border-color:#29378d; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-date-range input[type="date"] { color-scheme:dark; }
.co-date-quick {
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:4px 10px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:pointer;
  letter-spacing:0.3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.co-date-quick:hover { background:#29378d; color:#fff; border-color:#29378d; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-date-quick { background:#1e2230; }

/* Edit Plan toggle */
.co-edit-toggle {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:6px 12px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:all 0.15s ease;
}
.co-edit-toggle:hover { border-color:#29378d; color:#29378d; }
.co-edit-toggle.active {
  background:#29378d;
  border-color:#29378d;
  color:#fff;
}
.co-edit-toggle.active:hover { background:#1F3864; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-edit-toggle { background:#1e2230; }

/* Action column */
.co-th-action { text-align:center; }
.co-cell-action { text-align:center; white-space:nowrap; }
.co-row-edit-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:4px 10px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  cursor:pointer;
  letter-spacing:0.3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  transition:all 0.15s ease;
}
.co-row-edit-btn:hover {
  background:#29378d;
  border-color:#29378d;
  color:#fff;
}
/* Editable mode highlight */
.co-row-editable {
  background:rgba(41,55,141,0.03);
  outline:1px dashed rgba(41,55,141,0.30);
  outline-offset:-2px;
}

/* Adjust Assignment modal */
.co-adjust-overlay {
  position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:9999;
  background:rgba(15,23,42,0.55);
  backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  padding:24px;
  animation:coAdjFade 0.18s ease;
}
@keyframes coAdjFade { from { opacity:0; } to { opacity:1; } }
.co-adjust-card {
  width:min(640px, 100%);
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.co-adjust-head {
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between;
  padding:16px 20px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(41,55,141,0.06), rgba(31,56,100,0.04));
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-adjust-head {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(41,55,141,0.18), rgba(31,56,100,0.10));
}
.co-adjust-title { font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:var(--txt-1); }
.co-adjust-sub   { font-size: 9pt; color:var(--txt-muted); margin-top:3px; font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.co-adjust-close {
  background:transparent; border:none; cursor:pointer;
  font-size:16pt; line-height:1; color:var(--txt-muted);
  padding:0 6px; border-radius:6px;
}
.co-adjust-close:hover { color:#FF0000; }
.co-adjust-body {
  padding:18px 20px;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px;
}
.co-adjust-field { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; }
.co-adjust-field-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.co-adjust-field label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  letter-spacing:0.3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.co-adjust-field input,
.co-adjust-field select {
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:8px 12px;
  font-size:10pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  outline:none;
  font-family:inherit;
  transition:border-color 0.12s ease;
}
.co-adjust-field input:focus,
.co-adjust-field select:focus { border-color:#29378d; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-adjust-field input,
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-adjust-field select { color-scheme:dark; }
.co-adjust-foot {
  display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; gap:10px;
  padding:14px 20px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--surface-2);
}
.co-btn-cancel {
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:8px 18px;
  font-size:9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:pointer;
}
.co-btn-cancel:hover { background:var(--surface); color:var(--txt-1); }
.co-auto-badge {
  background:rgba(41,55,141,0.10);
  color:#29378d;
  border:1px solid rgba(41,55,141,0.25);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:5px 12px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:700;
}
.co-assign-table-wrap {
  overflow-x:auto;
  border:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius:9px;
  background:#ffffff;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table-wrap {
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  background:#112448;
}
.co-assign-table {
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:separate;
  border-spacing:0;
  font-size:9pt;
  color:#1e293b;
  font-family:var(--font-family);
}
.co-assign-table thead th {
  background:#f8fafc;
  text-align:left;
  padding:0 14px;
  height:44px;
  font-size:9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:#7F7F7F;
  letter-spacing:0.06em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.co-th-sort { font-size:9pt; opacity:0.5; margin-left:4px; }
.co-assign-table tbody td {
  padding:0 14px;
  height:50px;
  vertical-align:middle;
  border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;
  color:#1e293b;
}
.co-assign-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
.co-assign-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) { background:#fafbfc; }
.co-assign-table tbody tr:hover { background:rgba(41,55,141,0.05); }

/* Dark theme */
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table { color:#e8ecf5; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table thead th {
  background:#0d1c3a;
  color:rgba(200,215,240,0.55);
  border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table tbody td {
  color:#e8ecf5;
  border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-assign-table tbody tr:hover { background:rgba(96,165,250,0.06); }
.co-cell-well { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.co-well-link {
  color:#29378d;
  font-weight:700;
}
.co-cell-crew { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); font-weight:600; font-size: 9pt; }
.co-cell-mono { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); font-weight:600; }
.co-cell-score { font-weight:800; font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.co-avail-pill {
  display:inline-block;
  background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10);
  color:#00B050;
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:2px 10px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:700;
}
.co-reason-chip {
  display:inline-block;
  background:rgba(15,23,42,0.05);
  border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.10);
  color:var(--txt-1);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:2px 8px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  margin-right:5px;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-reason-chip {
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
}
.co-view-all {
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:14px;
  font-size:9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:#29378d;
  text-decoration:none;
}
.co-view-all:hover { text-decoration:underline; }

/* Map card */
.co-map-card {
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px 18px;
}
.co-map-head {
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-map-title {
  font-size:11pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  margin-bottom:3px;
}
.co-map-sub {
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  margin-bottom:8px;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
}
.co-map-controls {
  display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center;
  margin-left:auto;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-map-legend {
  display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-leg-item {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.co-leg-dot {
  display:inline-block;
  width:10px; height:10px;
  border-radius:50%;
}
.co-map-tabs {
  display:flex; gap:4px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:3px;
}
.co-map-tab {
  background:transparent;
  border:none;
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:5px 14px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:pointer;
}
.co-map-tab.active {
  background:#29378d;
  color:#fff;
}
.co-map-expand { padding:5px 10px; font-size:11pt; }
.co-map-row {
  display:flex; gap:14px;
  align-items:stretch;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.co-map-canvas-wrap {
  flex:1;
  min-width:0;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  overflow:hidden;
  background:#ffffff;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .co-map-canvas-wrap { background:#161922; }
#coMapCanvas { width:100%; display:block; }
.co-route-summary {
  width:230px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px 16px;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;
}
.co-route-title {
  font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.co-route-block { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; }
.co-route-label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
}
.co-route-val {
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size:14pt; font-weight:800;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.co-route-link {
  margin-top:auto;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:#29378d;
  text-decoration:none;
}
.co-route-link:hover { text-decoration:underline; }

/* Card */
.wca-card {
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  overflow:hidden;
}

/* Tabs */
.wca-tabs {
  display:flex;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--surface-2);
}
.wca-tab {
  border:none;
  background:transparent;
  padding:13px 20px;
  font-size:10pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:pointer;
  position:relative;
  transition:color 0.15s;
}
.wca-tab:hover { color:var(--txt-1); }
.wca-tab.active {
  color:var(--blue);
  background:var(--surface);
}
.wca-tab.active::after {
  content:'';
  position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:-1px;
  height:2px; background:var(--blue);
}

/* Two-button view toggle (Wells / Crews) â€” icons + tighter spacing */
.wca-view-toggle .wca-tab {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
}
.wca-view-toggle .wca-tab svg { opacity:0.7; transition:opacity 0.15s; }
.wca-view-toggle .wca-tab.active svg { opacity:1; }

/* Crew-mode-only Well filter */
.wca-crew-well-filter {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  padding:0 4px;
}
.wca-crew-well-filter label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600; color:var(--txt-muted);
  letter-spacing:0.3px; text-transform:uppercase;
}
.wca-crew-well-filter select {
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:5px 10px;
  font-size:9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  outline:none;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-family:inherit;
  transition:border-color 0.15s;
}
.wca-crew-well-filter select:hover { border-color:var(--blue); }
.wca-crew-well-filter select:focus { border-color:var(--blue); }

/* Crew row â€” discipline pill in project column */
.wca-disc-pill {
  display:inline-block;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  border:1px solid var(--disc-c, var(--blue));
  color:var(--disc-c, var(--blue));
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:1px 8px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.5px;
  margin-bottom:3px;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-disc-pill {
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}

/* Toolbar */
.wca-toolbar {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  padding:10px 16px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.wca-search-wrap {
  position:relative;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:6px 10px 6px 32px;
  width:220px;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.wca-search-wrap svg {
  position:absolute; left:10px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);
  width:14px; height:14px; color:var(--txt-muted);
}
.wca-search-wrap input {
  width:100%; border:none; background:transparent; outline:none;
  font-size:12.5px; color:var(--txt-1);
}
.wca-search-wrap input::placeholder { color:var(--txt-muted); }

.wca-legend {
  display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-2);
  flex:1;
  min-width:0;
}
.wca-legend-item { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; white-space:nowrap; }
.wca-leg-dot { width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
.wca-leg-bar { display:inline-block; width:18px; height:9px; border-radius:3px; border:1px solid transparent; }
.wca-leg-unassigned {
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #FF0000 0, #FF0000 4px, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 4px, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 8px);
  border:1px dashed #FF0000;
}
.wca-leg-diamond {
  display:inline-block;
  width:9px; height:9px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1.5px solid #7F7F7F;
  transform:rotate(45deg);
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-leg-diamond { background:#1e1e1e; }
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-leg-unassigned {
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #FF0000 0, #FF0000 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 8px);
}

.wca-toolbar-right {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  margin-left:auto;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.wca-pill-group {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:3px;
  gap:2px;
}
.wca-pill {
  border:none; background:transparent;
  padding:5px 12px; border-radius:6px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:all 0.15s;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.wca-pill:hover { color:var(--txt-1); }
.wca-pill.active { background:var(--blue); color:#fff; }

.wca-nav {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
  padding:3px 6px;
}
.wca-nav-btn {
  border:none; background:transparent;
  padding:0 8px;
  font-size:18px; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-2);
  cursor:pointer;
  line-height:1.4;
  border-radius:4px;
}
.wca-nav-btn:hover { background:var(--surface); color:var(--txt-1); }
.wca-nav-label {
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-1);
  min-width:140px;
  text-align:center;
}

.wca-today-btn {
  padding:6px 14px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--blue);
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--blue);
  border-radius:8px;
  cursor:pointer;
  white-space:nowrap;
  transition:all 0.15s;
}
.wca-today-btn:hover { background:var(--blue-soft); }

/* Calendar grid */
.wca-grid-wrap { overflow-x:auto; }
.wca-grid {
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0;
  table-layout:fixed;
}
.wca-grid thead th {
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:0;
  text-align:left;
  font-weight:600;
}
.wca-col-well {
  width:130px; min-width:130px;
  padding:10px 14px !important;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  letter-spacing:0.4px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
  vertical-align:bottom;
}
.wca-col-proj {
  width:140px; min-width:140px;
  padding:10px 14px !important;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  letter-spacing:0.4px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
  vertical-align:bottom;
}
.wca-col-cal { padding:0 !important; }

.wca-date-month {
  display:flex;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.wca-month-label {
  padding:6px 12px;
  border-right:1px dashed var(--border);
  text-align:left;
  white-space:nowrap;
  overflow:hidden;
  text-overflow:ellipsis;
}
.wca-month-label:last-child { border-right:none; }

.wca-date-header {
  display:grid;
}
.wca-dh-cell {
  border-left:1px solid var(--border-2);
  text-align:center;
  padding:5px 2px;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  position:relative;
  min-width:0;
}
.wca-dh-cell:first-child { border-left:none; }
.wca-dh-cell.is-wknd { background:rgba(0,0,0,0.025); }
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-dh-cell.is-wknd { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
.wca-dh-cell.is-today { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.06); }
.wca-dh-day {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.wca-dh-cell.is-today .wca-dh-day { color:var(--red); }
.wca-dh-dow {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  margin-top:1px;
  letter-spacing:0.3px;
}

/* Body */
.wca-row td {
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);
  padding:0;
  vertical-align:middle;
}
.wca-row:hover td { background:rgba(41,55,141,0.025); }
.wca-cell-well {
  padding:10px 14px !important;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size:9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--blue);
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
}
.wca-cell-proj {
  padding:10px 14px !important;
  font-size:9pt;
  color:var(--txt-2);
  border-right:1px solid var(--border);
}
.wca-cell-cal { padding:0 !important; }
.wca-cal-track {
  position:relative;
  height:42px;
}
.wca-row-grid {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  display:grid;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.wca-grid-cell {
  border-left:1px solid var(--border-2);
}
.wca-grid-cell:first-child { border-left:none; }
.wca-grid-cell.is-wknd { background:rgba(0,0,0,0.018); }
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-grid-cell.is-wknd { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.025); }

/* Bars */
.wca-bar {
  position:absolute;
  top:8px; height:24px;
  border-radius:4px;
  background:var(--cat-c, #29378d);
  color:#fff;
  font-size: 9pt;
  font-weight:600;
  display:flex; align-items:center;
  padding:0 8px;
  overflow:hidden;
  z-index:2;
  box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  cursor:default;
  transition:filter 0.12s;
}
.wca-bar:hover { filter:brightness(1.06); z-index:3; }
.wca-bar-label { white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }

.wca-bar-completed {
  background:#bbf7d0 !important;
  color:#15803d;
  border:1px solid #00B050;
  font-weight:700;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-bar-completed {
  background:rgba(74,222,128,0.18) !important;
  color:#00B050;
  border-color:#00B050;
}

.wca-bar-future {
  opacity:0.92;
}

.wca-bar-unassigned {
  background:transparent !important;
  color:#FF0000;
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,
    rgba(255,0,0,0.18) 0,
    rgba(255,0,0,0.18) 5px,
    rgba(255,0,0,0.04) 5px,
    rgba(255,0,0,0.04) 10px) !important;
  border:1.5px dashed #FF0000;
  font-weight:700;
}

/* Today line â€” solid green, continuous through every row */
.wca-today-line {
  position:absolute;
  top:-12px; bottom:-12px;
  width:2px;
  background:#00B050;
  z-index:6;
  pointer-events:none;
  border-radius:1px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(0,176,80,0.18);
}
/* "TODAY" header tag â€” sits above the green line in the date header */
.wca-today-tag {
  position:absolute;
  top:-1px; left:50%;
  transform:translateX(-50%);
  font-size:6.5pt; font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:0.4px;
  color:#00B050;
  background:var(--surface);
  padding:1px 5px;
  border:1px solid #00B050;
  border-radius:8px;
  white-space:nowrap;
  z-index:7;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
}
/* Make the today date cell slightly highlighted with a green tint instead of red */
.wca-dh-cell.is-today { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10) !important; }
.wca-dh-cell.is-today .wca-dh-day { color:#00B050 !important; }

/* Milestone marker */
.wca-milestone {
  position:absolute;
  top:34px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;
  transform:translateX(-50%);
  z-index:5;
  pointer-events:none;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.wca-ms-diamond {
  width:11px; height:11px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1.5px solid #7F7F7F;
  transform:rotate(45deg);
  flex-shrink:0;
}
html:not(.navbar-light) .wca-ms-diamond { background:#1e1e1e; border-color:#A5A5A5; }
.wca-ms-label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--txt-2);
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  background:var(--surface);
  padding:0 4px;
  border-radius:3px;
  display:none;
}

.wca-empty {
  padding:32px;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
}

/* Hierarchy explainer strip */
.wca-hier-bar {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  padding:9px 16px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-2);
}
.wca-hier-step {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.wca-hier-num {
  width:18px; height:18px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue);
  color:#fff;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:800;
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
}
.wca-hier-sub { color:var(--txt-muted); font-weight:500; font-size: 9pt; }
.wca-hier-arrow { color:var(--txt-muted); font-size:10pt; }
.wca-hier-tip {
  margin-left:auto;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--blue);
  font-style:italic;
  background:var(--blue-soft);
  padding:3px 9px;
  border-radius:10px;
}

/* Compact legend rendered above the calendar grid */
.wca-legend-top {
  display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
  padding:8px 14px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--surface-2);
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-2);
}
.wca-legend-group {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:0 10px;
  border-left:1px solid var(--border);
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.wca-legend-group:first-child { border-left:none; padding-left:0; }
.wca-legend-grouplbl {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.4px; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
}
.wca-leg-block { display:inline-block; width:12px; height:8px; border-radius:2px; }
.wca-leg-rig { width:12px; height:14px; vertical-align:-2px; }
.wca-leg-today {
  display:inline-block;
  width:3px; height:14px;
  background:#00B050;
  border-radius:1px;
  vertical-align:-2px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(0,176,80,0.25);
}
.wca-leg-gap {
  display:inline-block;
  width:18px; height:9px;
  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,
    rgba(165,165,165,0.35) 0,
    rgba(165,165,165,0.35) 3px,
    transparent 3px,
    transparent 6px);
  border:1px dashed #A5A5A5;
  border-radius:2px;
}

/* Indent + chevron for the hierarchy */
.wca-row-well .wca-cell-well,
.wca-row-milestone .wca-cell-well,
.wca-row-activity .wca-cell-well {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
}
.wca-chev {
  display:inline-block;
  width:14px; text-align:center;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color:var(--txt-muted);
  transition:transform 0.12s;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.wca-chev.open { transform:rotate(90deg); color:var(--blue); }
.wca-indent-1 { display:inline-block; width:16px; flex-shrink:0; }
.wca-indent-2 { display:inline-block; width:36px; flex-shrink:0; }

.wca-well-id {
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
  font-size:10pt; font-weight:800;
  color:var(--txt-1);
}
.wca-unassigned-flag {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:3px;
  margin-left:6px; padding:2px 6px;
  background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10);
  color:#FF0000;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,0.35);
  border-radius:10px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; line-height:1;
  cursor:pointer;
  vertical-align:middle;
}
.wca-unassigned-flag:hover {
  background:rgba(255,0,0,0.18);
  border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.55);
}
.wca-unassigned-flag svg { display:block; }
.wca-unassigned-flag-count { font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }

/* Clickable well-id link inside translated text (briefings, alerts, etc.) */
.wm-well-link {
  cursor:pointer;
  color:#29378d;
  text-decoration:underline;
  text-decoration-color:rgba(41,55,141,0.35);
  text-underline-offset:2px;
  transition:color .12s ease, text-decoration-color .12s ease, border-color .12s ease, background .12s ease;
}
.wm-well-link:hover {
  color:#29378d;
  text-decoration-color:#29378d;
}
/* When applied to a chip-style element (e.g. .sa-well-tag in Smart Alerts),
   keep the chip look but make it clearly clickable. */
.sa-well-tag.wm-well-link {
  text-decoration:none;
  color:#29378d;
}
.sa-well-tag.wm-well-link:hover {
  color:#29378d;
  border-color:rgba(41,55,141,0.55);
  background:rgba(41,55,141,0.08);
}

/* AI Recovery Assistant â€” trigger button on well detail page */
.aw-ai-rec-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  height:30px; padding:0 12px;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:#1F3864;
  color:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(41,55,141,0.5);
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:none;
  flex-shrink:0;
  transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  font-family:inherit;
}
.aw-ai-rec-btn:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:none; }
.aw-ai-rec-btn svg { display:block; }

/* AI Recovery Assistant â€” modal overlay */
.ai-rec-overlay {
  position:fixed; inset:0;
  background:rgba(8,12,28,0.55);
  z-index:99999;
  display:none;
  align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center;
  padding:30px 16px;
  overflow-y:auto;
  font-family: var(--font-family);
}
.ai-rec-overlay.open { display:flex; }
.ai-rec-panel {
  width:100%; max-width:900px;
  background:#f5f5fa;
  border-radius:14px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  max-height:calc(100vh - 60px);
}
.ai-rec-head {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1f3a 0%, #2a2748 100%);
  color:#fff;
  padding:14px 16px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.ai-rec-head-icon {
  width:32px; height:32px; flex-shrink:0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, #29378d, #5b21b6);
  color:#fff;
  border-radius:8px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
}
.ai-rec-head-title { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; }
.ai-rec-head-sub   { font-size: 9pt; opacity:0.65; margin-top:2px; }
.ai-rec-close {
  background:transparent; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  border:none; font-size:16px; cursor:pointer; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:6px;
}
.ai-rec-close:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color:#fff; }

.ai-rec-body { padding:14px 16px 16px; overflow-y:auto; }

.ai-rec-sec-label {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#6b7280;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.ai-rec-section.ai-rec-analyze {
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:10px;
  padding:12px 14px;
}
.ai-rec-well-id  { font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e; }
.ai-rec-well-pdo { font-size:9pt; color:#6b7280; margin-top:1px; }
.ai-rec-well-meta{ font-size:9pt; color:#6b7280; margin-top:1px; }
.ai-rec-risk-line { font-size:9pt; color:#FF0000; font-weight:600; margin-top:8px; }

.ai-rec-actions { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
.ai-rec-card {
  display:flex; gap:12px;
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:10px;
  padding:12px 14px;
  animation:aiRecCardIn .35s ease-out both;
  transition:border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
}
.ai-rec-card.approved { border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.45); background:rgba(0,176,80,0.04); }
.ai-rec-card.rejected { border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.40); background:rgba(255,0,0,0.04); opacity:0.75; }
@keyframes aiRecCardIn {
  0%   { opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px); }
  100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
}

/* Thinking indicator */
.ai-rec-thinking {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  margin:10px 0 4px;
  font-size: 9pt; color:#6b21a8; font-weight:600;
}
.ai-rec-think-text { margin-left:4px; }
.ai-rec-think-dot {
  width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%;
  background:#29378d;
  animation:aiRecThinkPulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.ai-rec-think-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:0.15s; }
.ai-rec-think-dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:0.30s; }
@keyframes aiRecThinkPulse {
  0%,80%,100% { opacity:0.25; transform:scale(0.85); }
  40%         { opacity:1;    transform:scale(1.15); }
}

/* Loading skeleton card */
.ai-rec-card.ai-rec-skel { animation:none; }
.ai-rec-card.ai-rec-skel .ai-rec-card-num {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ede9fe, #ddd6fe);
  position:relative;
}
.ai-rec-dot-pulse {
  width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:#29378d;
  animation:aiRecDotPulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes aiRecDotPulse {
  0%,100% { transform:scale(0.7); opacity:0.5; }
  50%     { transform:scale(1.1); opacity:1;   }
}
.ai-rec-skel-line {
  height:9px; border-radius:4px; margin-top:8px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, #ececf3 0%, #f7f7fb 50%, #ececf3 100%);
  background-size:200% 100%;
  animation:aiRecShimmer 1.4s linear infinite;
}
.ai-rec-skel-line:first-child { margin-top:0; }
.ai-rec-skel-line.w55 { width:55%; }
.ai-rec-skel-line.w70 { width:70%; }
.ai-rec-skel-line.w95 { width:95%; }
@keyframes aiRecShimmer {
  0%   { background-position:200% 0; }
  100% { background-position:-200% 0; }
}

/* Approve / reject controls */
.ai-rec-decide {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  margin-top:10px;
}
.ai-rec-decide-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  width:24px; height:24px; padding:0;
  border-radius:6px;
  border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  background:#fff;
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .12s ease, background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, color .15s ease;
}
.ai-rec-decide-btn svg { display:block; }
.ai-rec-decide-btn.approve { color:#00B050; }
.ai-rec-decide-btn.approve:hover { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.12); border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.45); transform:translateY(-1px); }
.ai-rec-decide-btn.reject  { color:#FF0000; }
.ai-rec-decide-btn.reject:hover  { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10); border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.45); transform:translateY(-1px); }
.ai-rec-decide-status {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.3px;
  padding:3px 8px; border-radius:5px;
  border:1px solid transparent;
}
.ai-rec-decide-status.approved { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10); color:#00B050; border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.30); }
.ai-rec-decide-status.rejected { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10); color:#FF0000; border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.30); }
.ai-rec-card-num {
  width:26px; height:26px; flex-shrink:0;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ede9fe, #ddd6fe);
  color:#5b21b6;
  font-weight:700; font-size:9pt;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  font-family:var(--font-family-mono);
}
.ai-rec-card-body { flex:1; min-width:0; }
.ai-rec-card-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e; }
.ai-rec-card-desc  { font-size:9pt; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.45; margin-top:4px; }
.ai-rec-tags { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-top:8px; }
.ai-rec-tag {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.3px;
  padding:3px 8px; border-radius:5px;
  border:1px solid transparent;
}
.ai-rec-tag-red    { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.10); color:#FF0000; border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.25); }
.ai-rec-tag-amber  { background:rgba(255,192,0,0.10); color:#b45309; border-color:rgba(255,192,0,0.25); }
.ai-rec-tag-blue   { background:rgba(41,55,141,0.10); color:#29378d; border-color:rgba(41,55,141,0.25); }
.ai-rec-tag-green  { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10); color:#00B050; border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.25); }
.ai-rec-tag-purple { background:rgba(124,58,237,0.10); color:#29378d; border-color:rgba(124,58,237,0.25); }

.ai-rec-impact {
  margin-top:14px;
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.18); border-radius:10px;
  padding:12px 14px;
}
.ai-rec-impact-head {
  font-size: 9pt; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#29378d;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.ai-rec-impact-row { display:flex; align-items:stretch; gap:10px; }
.ai-rec-impact-cell { flex:1; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; text-align:center; border:1px solid transparent; }
.ai-rec-impact-cell.red   { background:rgba(255,0,0,0.08); border-color:rgba(255,0,0,0.25); }
.ai-rec-impact-cell.green { background:rgba(0,176,80,0.10); border-color:rgba(0,176,80,0.30); }
.ai-rec-impact-label { font-size: 9pt; color:#6b7280; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.4px; }
.ai-rec-impact-cell.red .ai-rec-impact-val   { color:#FF0000; }
.ai-rec-impact-cell.green .ai-rec-impact-val { color:#00B050; }
.ai-rec-impact-val { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; margin-top:2px; font-family:var(--font-family-mono); }
.ai-rec-impact-arrow { display:flex; align-items:center; color:#9ca3af; font-size:18px; }
.ai-rec-savings { text-align:center; font-size:9pt; color:#29378d; margin-top:10px; font-weight:500; }
.ai-rec-savings b { font-weight:700; }

.ai-rec-foot {
  display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:14px;
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:10px;
  padding:10px;
}
